# Online Movie Booking System

## Project Description

The Online Movie Booking System is a web-based application developed using React and Vite. It provides users with an easy and convenient way to browse movies, select seats, and manage their movie ticket bookings.

The main objective of this project is to simplify the movie ticket booking process through a user-friendly web interface.

## Features

- **User Registration:** New users can create an account.
- **User Login:** Registered users can log in to the application.
- **Movie Listing:** Users can view available movies.
- **Seat Booking:** Users can select seats for their preferred movie.
- **My Bookings:** Users can view their booking details.
- **Admin Movie Management:** Admin can manage movie information.
- **Navigation:** Users can easily navigate between different pages.

